          "body": "France's scoring over their last 11 games stands at 426 points, with 291 conceded. That works out at 38.7 points scored and 26.5 conceded per game across the window. Their biggest win in that run was 54-12 away to Wales in February's Six Nations. Their most recent result was a 42-15 win over Japan, and Fiji are next."
