          "heading": "Quesada welcomes back Capuozzo, names Nicotera captain without Lamaro against Springboks",
          "body": "Azzurri head coach Gonzalo Quesada has named his side for the Nations Championship clash with world champions South Africa in Turin without captain Michele Lamaro, Tommaso Menoncello or Juan Ignacio Brex, all sidelined. Hooker Giacomo Nicotera leads the team in Lamaro's absence, while wing Ange Capuozzo returns to start for the first time since the Six Nations. Paolo Garbisi and Alessandro Fusco renew their half-back partnership. Italy are missing 16 players through injury, according to the federation's preview."
        },
