          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Townsend restores Russell and Tuipulotu to start against All Blacks",
          "body": "Finn Russell returns at fly-half and captain Sione Tuipulotu at centre, both missing from the Fiji win in July. Rory Sutherland is the only forward retained from the Fiji side, and vice-captain Rory Darge is back. Saturday's Test is the first of four this month for Scotland. Townsend says New Zealand are \"playing much more ambitious rugby.\" Scotland have never beaten the All Blacks."
