          "heading": "Alex Mann starts against Japan as fans question his physical profile",
          "body": "Cardiff's Alex Mann is in Wales' side for Saturday's Nations Championship match with Japan. WalesOnline's Steffan Thomas writes that much of the criticism he attracts centres on his physical profile, with some supporters preferring a bigger presence. Wales' coaching staff and team-mates rate him highly. His relentless defensive work, the report says, frees Jac Morgan and Aaron Wainwright to carry more in the wider channels. One unnamed coach says the 24-year-old shows little regard for his own wellbeing when putting his body on the line."
