          "body": "Ireland beat Argentina 42-12 at the Aviva Stadium, with Hugo Keenan scoring three of their six tries. Two Argentina players were sin-binned, and captain Julian Montoya was lost to a failed head injury assessment before half-time. Mateo Carreras scored both Argentina tries, but Ireland led 21-5 at the break. The defeat leaves Argentina with three losses in four games, with trips to Italy and France to come."
