          "heading": "Kingsley Jones, ex-Wales international, back in Japan camp this week",
          "body": "Kingsley Jones, who left Canada's head-coach job last year, has spent this week in Japan's camp, Eddie Jones said on Thursday. The coach joked, \"He can talk, mate!\", before adding that he was there to watch and feed back on how Japan can improve. Japan's coach also met Wales coach Steve Tandy at a world rugby coaches' conference this week and says he has a good idea how Wales will play. Japan's onus, he said, is to disrupt that gameplan at the Principality Stadium on Saturday."
